,"passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 5.1%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $922M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":0,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 71.4%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.15"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":61.85,"default_fair_val":61.85,"premium_pct":-42.6,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":21.9,"pe_forward":19.3,"pb_trailing":3.9,"pb_forward":3.5,"div_yield":7.52,"ps_ratio":3.1,"fcf_to_ev":5.3,"fcf_to_mcap":8.08,"liab_to_assets":71.4,"cash_to_assets":0,"current_ratio":0.15,"roe":17.8,"roa":5.1,"moat":{"ticker":"UDR","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"UDR 在住宅房地產領域擁有一定的品牌知名度，但其定價權相對有限。作為 REIT，其租金收入主要受市場供需影響，而非獨特的品牌溢價。雖然 UDR 的物業品質和服務能吸引租戶，但與奢侈品牌或必需消費品相比，其品牌壁壘較弱。競爭對手眾多，租戶在選擇時有較多替代選項，這限制了 UDR 顯著提高租金的能力。因此，品牌在定價方面的作用屬於中等水平。","comment_en":"UDR possesses some brand recognition within the residential real estate sector, but its pricing power is relatively limited. As a REIT, its rental income is primarily influenced by market supply and demand rather than unique brand premiums. While UDR's property quality and services attract tenants, its brand barrier is weaker compared to luxury brands or essential consumer goods. With numerous competitors, tenants have many alternatives when choosing, which limits UDR's ability to significantly increase rents. Therefore, the brand's role in pricing is moderate."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"住宅房地產行業，特別是 REITs，幾乎不受專利或監管特許權的保護。UDR 的業務模式不依賴於任何受專利保護的技術或獨家監管許可。其運營主要受土地使用、建築規範和租賃法規的影響，這些是行業的普遍要求，而非 UDR 獨有的壁壘。因此，在專利和監管這一維度上，UDR 的護城河幾乎不存在。","comment_en":"The residential real estate industry, especially REITs, is virtually unprotected by patents or regulatory franchises. UDR's business model does not rely on any patented technology or exclusive regulatory licenses. Its operations are primarily influenced by land use, building codes, and leasing regulations, which are common industry requirements rather than unique barriers for UDR. Therefore, in terms of patents and regulation, UDR's moat is virtually non-existent."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於住宅租賃而言，租戶的轉換成本相對較高。搬家涉及時間、金錢（押金、搬家費用）和精力，以及重新適應新環境的麻煩。UDR 的物業通常提供良好的設施和便利的地理位置，這增加了租戶的黏性。一旦租戶在 UDR 的物業中安頓下來，並享受其提供的便利和服務，他們傾向於續租，以避免搬家的成本和不便。這構成了 UDR 相當穩固的護城河。","comment_en":"For residential rentals, tenant switching costs are relatively high. Moving involves time, money (deposits, moving expenses), and effort, as well as the hassle of adapting to a new environment. UDR's properties typically offer good amenities and convenient locations, which increases tenant stickiness. Once tenants are settled in UDR's properties and enjoy the conveniences and services provided, they tend to renew their leases to avoid the costs and inconveniences of moving. This constitutes a fairly solid moat for UDR."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"住宅房地產業務通常不具備顯著的網絡效應。UDR 的租賃業務不依賴於用戶數量的增加來提升產品或服務的價值。每個租戶的價值是獨立的，並且不會因為有更多租戶入住同一棟或同一社區而增加。雖然社區內的設施共享可能帶來一些協同效應，但這與真正的網絡效應（如社交媒體或市場平台）有本質區別。因此，網絡效應對 UDR 而言不是一個有效的護城河。","comment_en":"Residential real estate businesses typically do not possess significant network effects. UDR's leasing business does not rely on an increase in user numbers to enhance the value of its products or services. The value of each tenant is independent and does not increase due to more tenants occupying the same building or community. While shared amenities within a community might offer some synergy, this is fundamentally different from true network effects (like social media or marketplaces). Therefore, network effects are not an effective moat for UDR."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為一家大型 REIT，UDR 在規模經濟方面具有一定的優勢。其龐大的物業組合使其能夠在採購（如保險、維護材料）、融資（獲得更有利的貸款條件）和管理（攤銷總部費用）方面獲得更低的單位成本。此外，規模化的運營有助於標準化流程，提高效率。雖然房地產開發本身存在規模效應，但 UDR 的規模使其在運營和融資層面具備了成本競爭力，構成一道堅固的護城河。","comment_en":"As a large REIT, UDR has certain advantages in economies of scale. Its extensive property portfolio allows it to achieve lower unit costs in procurement (e.g., insurance, maintenance materials), financing (obtaining more favorable loan terms), and management (amortizing overhead costs). Furthermore, scaled operations help standardize processes and improve efficiency. While real estate development itself has scale effects, UDR's size provides it with cost competitiveness in operations and financing, forming a solid moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"UDR 在美國多個高增長、高人口密度的市場擁有大量優質物業組合，這些地理位置的稀缺性是其重要的壁壘。特別是在一線城市及其周邊地區，土地供應有限，新建成本高昂，使得現有優質物業的價值難以被複製。這些核心區域的物業能夠持續吸引租戶，並在租賃市場中保持較強的競爭力。這種對特定地理位置的深度佈局和資產的獨特性，構成了 UDR 罕見的護城河。","comment_en":"UDR owns a substantial portfolio of high-quality properties in multiple high-growth, high-density markets across the United States, and the scarcity of these locations represents a significant barrier. Especially in first-tier cities and their surrounding areas, land supply is limited, and new construction costs are high, making the value of existing prime properties difficult to replicate. Properties in these core areas can continuously attract tenants and maintain strong competitiveness in the rental market. This deep positioning in specific geographies and the uniqueness of its assets constitute a rare moat for UDR."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"UDR 在其物業管理和運營效率方面表現出色。公司採用先進的技術和流程來優化租戶服務、維護管理和租金徵收。其線上平台和客戶服務系統旨在提升租戶體驗並簡化運營。通過精細化的成本控制和對物業資產的持續優化，UDR 能夠在維持高入住率的同時，實現穩定的現金流。這種卓越的運營能力是其堅實的護城河之一。","comment_en":"UDR excels in its property management and operational efficiency. The company employs advanced technologies and processes to optimize tenant services, maintenance management, and rent collection. Its online platforms and customer service systems are designed to enhance the tenant experience and streamline operations. Through meticulous cost control and continuous optimization of its property assets, UDR can achieve stable cash flow while maintaining high occupancy rates. This operational excellence is one of its solid moats."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"UDR 在資本配置方面展現出較為審慎和有效的策略。公司在購置、開發和處置物業方面，能夠根據市場週期和自身財務狀況做出明智決策。同時，UDR 也注重通過股息支付和股票回購來回報股東。其對債務的管理也相對穩健，維持著合理的槓桿水平。這種在資產增值、現金流產生和股東回報之間取得平衡的能力，體現了其優秀的資本配置，構成一道堅固的護城河。","comment_en":"UDR demonstrates a relatively prudent and effective strategy in capital allocation. The company makes wise decisions regarding the acquisition, development, and disposition of properties based on market cycles and its financial condition. Concurrently, UDR focuses on returning value to shareholders through dividend payments and share buybacks. Its debt management is also relatively sound, maintaining reasonable leverage levels. This ability to balance asset appreciation, cash flow generation, and shareholder returns reflects its excellent capital allocation, forming a solid moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，UDR 的客戶保留率相對較高，這得益於其優質的物業、便利的設施和良好的客戶服務。公司積極與租戶溝通，並提供有競爭力的續租條款，以鼓勵長期居住。高客戶保留率不僅降低了空置率和獲客成本，也為公司帶來了更穩定和可預測的收入流。這顯示了 UDR 在維護客戶關係方面的能力，構成了其堅固的護城河。","comment_en":"As mentioned in M3, UDR's customer retention rate is relatively high, owing to its quality properties, convenient amenities, and good customer service. The company actively communicates with tenants and offers competitive renewal terms to encourage long-term stays. High customer retention not only reduces vacancy rates and customer acquisition costs but also provides the company with a more stable and predictable revenue stream. This demonstrates UDR's capability in maintaining customer relationships, forming its solid moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"住宅 REIT 的業務模式具有較強的持久性，因為住房需求是相對穩定的。UDR 的多元化地理佈局和對優質物業的專注，使其能夠抵禦區域性經濟波動。儘管經濟週期會影響租金增長和入住率，但其核心資產和穩定的租戶基礎提供了較強的韌性。只要公司能持續有效地管理其資產並適應市場變化，其業務模式就能保持長期的可持續性，構成一道堅固的護城河。","comment_en":"The business model of residential REITs possesses strong durability, as housing demand is relatively stable. UDR's diversified geographic exposure and focus on high-quality properties enable it to withstand regional economic fluctuations. Although economic cycles affect rent growth and occupancy rates, its core assets and stable tenant base provide significant resilience. As long as the company can continue to effectively manage its assets and adapt to market changes, its business model can maintain long-term sustainability, forming a solid moat."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"UDR 的經濟護城河主要體現在其核心地理位置的稀缺性（M6）、租戶轉換成本（M3）、規模帶來的運營與融資優勢（M5）、卓越的運營效率（M7）以及穩健的資本配置（M8）和客戶保留能力（M9）。這些因素共同構成了一道堅固的護城河，使其在住宅房地產市場中具有競爭優勢。然而，其品牌定價權（M1）和網絡效應（M4）相對較弱，且不受專利監管壁壘（M2）保護。整體而言，UDR 屬於一種「收費橋」類型的商業模式，依賴於其優質資產和高效運營來產生穩定的租金收入。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"UDR's economic moat is primarily reflected in the scarcity of its prime geographic locations (M6), tenant switching costs (M3), operational and financing advantages from scale (M5), excellent operational efficiency (M7), and sound capital allocation (M8) and customer retention capabilities (M9). These factors collectively form a solid moat, giving it a competitive edge in the residential real estate market. However, its brand pricing power (M1) and network effects (M4) are relatively weak, and it is not protected by patent or regulatory barriers (M2). Overall, UDR operates a 'toll bridge' type business model, relying on its high-quality assets and efficient operations to generate stable rental income.","evidenceHash":"f1692eef3378f3e1ab5ed518a8bedce7e6a5b2e0f2e57c07d6d8ba76d8466920","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T05:19:36.053Z","evidenceHash":"f0218f4bf8629b728cf173d6e516783c632362f479ce6b02eb0d774a4f650b24"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T05:19:36.053Z","evidenceHash":"f0218f4bf8629b728cf173d6e516783c632362f479ce6b02eb0d774a4f650b24"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/UDR.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/UDR.png","website":"https://www.udr.com","ceo":"Thomas W. Toomey","full_time_employees":"1420","description":"UDR, Inc. (NYSE: UDR), a distinguished S&P 500 company, stands as a premier multifamily real estate investment trust. The company boasts a proven history of generating exceptional and reliable returns for its investors, achieving this through the astute management, acquisition, disposition, development, and redevelopment of appealing real estate properties situated in key U.S. markets. As of September 30, 2020, UDR's extensive portfolio included ownership or partial ownership in 51,649 apartment homes, with an additional 1,031 units currently under development. With over 48 years in operation, UDR has consistently delivered long-term value to its shareholders, provided superior service to its residents, and fostered a high-quality experience for its associates.","description_en":"UDR, Inc. (NYSE: UDR), a distinguished S&P 500 company, stands as a premier multifamily real estate investment trust. The company boasts a proven history of generating exceptional and reliable returns for its investors, achieving this through the astute management, acquisition, disposition, development, and redevelopment of appealing real estate properties situated in key U.S. markets. As of September 30, 2020, UDR's extensive portfolio included ownership or partial ownership in 51,649 apartment homes, with an additional 1,031 units currently under development. With over 48 years in operation, UDR has consistently delivered long-term value to its shareholders, provided superior service to its residents, and fostered a high-quality experience for its associates.","description_zh":"UDR, Inc.（美股代碼：UDR）為 Real Estate 領域之重要企業，專注於 REIT - Residential 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"1745 Shea Center Drive","city":"Highlands Ranch","state":"CO","zip":"80129-1540","country":"US","phone":"720-283-6120","full_address":"1745 Shea Center Drive, Highlands Ranch, CO 80129-1540, US","range_52w":"32.94-42","year_high":42,"year_low":32.94,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":32.94,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-07-24","name":"Bragg David D.","title":"officer: SVP - Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":2134,"price":39.48,"total_val":0.08},{"date":"2026-06-08","name":"TOOMEY THOMAS W","title":"director, officer: Chairman, President and CEO","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":80000,"price":39.25,"total_val":3.14},{"date":"2026-02-17","name":"CATTANACH KATHERINE A","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"J-Other","shares":4044,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-02-17","name":"CATTANACH KATHERINE A","title":"Officer / Director","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-02-17","name":"BENSON KEITH","title":"officer: SVP-Chief Legal Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":12330,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-02-17","name":"BENSON KEITH","title":"officer: SVP-Chief Legal Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":2845,"price":38.17,"total_val":0.11},{"da